        "html": "<div class=\"card__section expandable-content expandable-content--expandable\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"padding: 5px\">\n<div class=\"rte text--pull\">\nOne of the most enjoyable parts of collecting model vehicles is to find the model cars&amp; trucks which remind you of interesting or important memories.  At Hearns Hobbies we are all about celebrating these events so we are proud to stock an exciting range of Australian cars and trucks.  Many of these are extremely limited release so make sure you get yours before they are all gone.\n</div>\n<button class=\"expandable-content__toggle\" style=\"padding:5px\">                             <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-icon\"></span>                         <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-text\" data-view-more=\"View more\" data-view-less=\"View less\">View more</span>                    </button>\n</div>"
